{"data": [{"article": {"title": "缠中说禅：当我开始做自媒体，才逐渐看懂什么叫“走势终完美”"}, "author_id": "1606907639954571265", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:31:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113926235739099314"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2113…", "end": 55, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113924092223201281", "start": 32, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113924092223201281", "url": "https://t.co/f9CH9Ffyuy"}]}, "id": "2113926235739099314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "本文为个人对缠论理论及其哲学意义的研究与思考，不构成投资建议。 https://t.co/f9CH9Ffyuy", "url": "https://x.com/w610254/status/2113926235739099314"}, {"author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:12:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113529026962948338"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zhishuzengzhan…", "end": 132, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113422343569858735", "start": 109, "url": "https://t.co/6N5cWNGfCR"}]}, "id": "2113529026962948338", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 13483, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113422343569858735", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "昨天易中天里的几十亿爆仓盘，不过是一群贪鬼的集体火葬。今天的暴力反弹，与你又何干？\n\n昨天新易盛光脚阴线、近200亿成交砸出来的，不是什么“AI信仰崩塌”，是市场高潮中，里那些拿杠杆当信仰的私募，被贪婪按在地上摩擦。 https://t.co/6N5cWNGfCR", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113529026962948338"}, {"article": {"title": "A股行情展望"}, "author_id": "2029884642464268288", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113993944510140496"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2113…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113989656849309696", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113989656849309696", "url": "https://t.co/utGeJeYn2s"}]}, "id": "2113993944510140496",