//x.com/ShockBear240458/status/2113464328309387713"}, {"article": {"title": "《沈冰自述：我和周永康的故事》全景深度解读"}, "author_id": "2024405719940820992", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:44:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113521874411954178"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2112…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2112830908336144384", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2112830908336144384", "url": "https://t.co/yyWjILHOLy"}]}, "id": "2113521874411954178", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 32839, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "https://t.co/yyWjILHOLy", "url": "https://x.com/cha747888/status/2113521874411954178"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113551847986532353"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:43:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113551884158124343"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FCHwNoqjxt", "end": 91, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113551884158124343/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113551847986532353", "start": 68, "url": "https://t.co/FCHwNoqjxt"}]}, "id": "2113551884158124343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/FCHwNoqjxt", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113551884158124343"}, {"author_id": "1786121413767938048", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:11:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113740073841938471"], "id": "2113740073841938471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 371, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "虚云老和尚（三十一）：九十五岁，他梦见六祖来找他：时至矣，汝当回去\n\n1934年，虚云九十五岁。\n\n这一年春天，他还在鼓山。\n\n从十九岁在这里出家，到九十岁重新回来整顿，前后已经跨过七十多年。", "url": "https://x.com/Tylertruthfx/status/2113740073841