": 126, "start": 122, "tag": "买卖点"}]}, "id": "2113629387207626784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【缠论节奏 1/5】\n\n高手和低手的真正差距，往往不在选股，而在节奏。\n\n轮动只是节奏的一种表现，真正的核心节奏是买卖点。没有买卖点作为基础，任何轮动都是瞎转。\n\n你现在的操作，更多是在“追热点”，还是在等明确的买卖点？\n\n#缠论 #技术分析 #买卖点", "url": "https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2113629387207626784"}, {"author_id": "857945237104111618", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:27:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113547942506406249"], "id": "2113547942506406249", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3251, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "凡是kdj/macd/rsi的都是水货，\n凡是缠论的都是蠢货，\n凡是数浪的都是二货。", "url": "https://x.com/xuyuinfo5/status/2113547942506406249"}, {"author_id": "2042445486741766144", "created_at": "2026-10-24T12:20:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113968842825490546"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 53, "start": 50, "tag": "缠论"}]}, "id": "2113968842825490546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易市场总是少数人成功,\n\n你最大的对手，真的是别人吗？\n\n认识自己、把握自己，比征服世界更难。\n\n#缠论", "url": "https://x.com/xingluoL666/status/2113968842825490546"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113443547638829056"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:33:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113443564395069888"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VdVGZFnOsc", "end": 45, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113443564395069888/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113443547638829056", "start": 22, "url": "https://t.co/VdVGZFnOsc"}]}, "id": "2113443564395069888", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "霜降染层林\n登高赏秋色\n弘扬缠论\n惠泽众生 https://t.co/VdVGZFnOsc", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113443564395069888"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114019943419363328"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:47:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114021077710201111"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/32Wg6idQeP", "end": 96, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114021077710201111/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114019943419363328", "start": 73, "url": "https://t.co/32Wg6idQeP"}]}, "id": "2114021077710201111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "大饼8万已破，缠论走势结构拆解是市场走势最精确的分析，必须把所有走势分类了然于胸，才能对市场走势有一个精确的把握。\nbitcoin:native https://t.co/32Wg6idQeP", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2114021077710201111"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113624620901220352"]}, "author_id": "1868006938258128896", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:32:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113624625418489967"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/huUJqZMggh", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/wangjiziji/status/2113624625418489967/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113624620901220352", "start": 140, "url": "https://t.co/huUJqZMggh"}]}, "id": "2113624625418489967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🙏🙏🙏\n\n《谛深⼤师开⽰辑》-大众当共修！\n\n坐下弟子及声闻善知识众，汝等于群中听法，虽心得必然，却少有证！是乃修行\n大忌！\n\n何故是说？一切邪魔外道皆以是因缘，候其方便，飞精附体，口说经法，令众堕\n落！\n\n善知识，一切佛法皆实证门，故诸佛世尊，皆警告大众，凡有言说，皆无实义！ https://t.co/huUJqZMggh", "url": "https://x.com/wangjiziji/status/2113624625418489967"}, {"author_id": "1642055218199429126", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:47:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113658469740167410"], "id": "2113658469740167410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BTC 行情观察｜10月23日\nBTC 从 84,000 美元上方回落至 81,500 美元附近，短线结构转弱，但 4 小时级别暂未确认反转。\n从缠论看，近期虽然出现了 S1 和 NESTED_SELL，但当时 4 小时趋势仍为 UP，因此没有通过当前策略的空头过滤。价格目前运行在 4 小时中枢约 81,166～83,150 区间附近。\n关键位置：\n-", "url": "https://x.com/xisi39341944284/status/2113658469740167410"}, {"author_id": "1059979808292069376", "created_at": "2026-10-24T06:52:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113886435891990685"], "id": "2113886435891990685", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论，灰熊111比108啃下勇士，这比分本身就把比赛性质说清了——两队缠到最后才分胜负。\n\n勇士又是在关键回合没顶住，输球方式比输球本身更让人难受。\n\n灰熊这边咬住比分的劲头值得夸一句，赢就赢在没松那口气。", "url": "https://x.com/tarsixseveneig1/status/2113886435891990685"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113545649287467008"]}, "author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:18:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113545668434460755"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5onpafAkzV", "end": 151, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113545668434460755/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113545649287467008", "start": 128, "url": "https://t.co/5onpafAkzV"}]}, "id": "2113545668434460755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易，是有规律的，而且这规律是万古不变的，交易是以时间的不可逆为前提完全等价反映在价格轨迹上。在逻辑上更严谨的说法就是：把满足该条规律的市场称为价格充分有效市场，缠论系统就是针对这种价格充分有效市场的，而这种市场，至少对应了目前世界上所有正式的交易市场。 https://t.co/5onpafAkzV", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2113545668434460755"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113615124804349952"]}, "author_id": "1367651520611684355", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113992658360168618"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sDI310s1vg", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ruyi3699/status/2113992658360168618/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113615124804349952", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/sDI310s1vg"}]}, "id": "2113992658360168618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "量化交易想入门研究，开源项目阿布量化（ABU）可以了解一下。\n\nA 股、美股、港股、期货、期权、比特币，一套系统全包了，想在各个市场摸索量化策略的人挺适合。\n\n亮点有这么几个：\n\n① 多市场支持：股票、期货到加密资产都覆盖到了\n② 策略分析：缠论、波浪理论、形态识别这些方法都用上了\n③ https://t.co/sDI310s1vg", "url": "https://x.com/ruyi3699/status/2113992658360168618"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113526602055524352"]}, "author_id": "1685620377941364736", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:03:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113526800852901983"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 12, "start": 0, "tag": "万倍基哥btc合约复盘"}, {"end": 18, "start": 14, "tag": "btc"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lyDmyMNJou", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113526800852901983/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113526602055524352", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/lyDmyMNJou"}, {"display_url": "x.com/zhishuzengzhan…", "end": 181, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113088761865318660", "start": 158, "url": "https://t.co/9Tu3U2BzSB"}]}, "id": "2113526800852901983", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 866, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113088761865318660", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "#万倍基哥btc合约复盘  #btc \n\n30分钟中枢震荡背景下，5分钟一类卖点进空，目标就砸破中枢下沿平仓，中途再用小级别加仓，用多级别共振做空打法。\n\n大级别定方向，小级别抓精准，破位后动能放大利润。但震荡格局里加仓是把双刃剑，一旦假突破反转，成本容易瞬间失控。 https://t.co/lyDmyMNJou https://t.co/9Tu3U2BzSB", "url": "https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2113526800852901983"}, {"author_id": "826478551201349632", "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:16:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114013270919295448"], "id": "2114013270919295448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1728, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "科创如果在1600附近不能止跌\n那么下破到1500几率就增加了\n\n科创如果在1500附近不能止跌\n那么下破到1400几率就增加了\n\n科创如果在1400附近不能止跌\n那么下破到1300几率就增加了\n\n科创如果在1300附近不能止跌\n那么下破到1200几率就增加了\n\n科创如果在1200附近不能止跌\n那么下破到1100几率就增加了", "url": "https://x.com/Walking_Alpha_/status/2114013270919295448"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113580619884347392"]}, "author_id": "1865771438671810560", "created_at": "2026-10-24T00:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113791582419693736"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mDzS6Wlmh8", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bkdgiffug/status/2113791582419693736/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113580619884347392", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/mDzS6Wlmh8"}]}, "id": "2113791582419693736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 1372, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "那些张口就来的炒股 AI 分析，真别再信了——听着唬人，落地全是废话。\n\n给你挖了个开源项目：UZI-Skill（游资技能库），A 股、港股、美股一锅端的 AI 投研引擎。最新那版还把大伙儿惦记的 Serenity 白毛女神塞进了看盘班子，既养眼又能打。\n\n我看最狠的是这几处：\n1️⃣ 66 https://t.co/mDzS6Wlmh8", "url": "https://x.com/bkdgiffug/status/2113791582419693736"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113821708633464832", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113551847986532353", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113443547638829056", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2114019943419363328", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113624620901220352", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113545649287467008", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113615124804349952", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113526602055524352", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113580619884347392", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "1606907639954571265", "name": "冯大锤", "username": "w610254"}, {"id": "1685620377941364736", "name": "万倍基哥", "username": "zhishuzengzhang"}, {"id": "2029884642464268288", "name": "Milla", "username": "hanhanmilla"}, {"id": "1847908346155917312", "name": "5块的糖", "username": "17zxhold"}, {"id": "1855156089798742016", "name": "Chen Jacky", "username": "ChenJacky288066"}, {"id": "1990512523800686594", "name": "Web3老砖家", "username"